Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.87,0:00:01.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:03.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.18,0:00:06.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll ask just in case, but...{I'm asking this, just in case.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.58,0:00:08.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:10.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What month is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:12.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, what month you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:20.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's May.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.69,0:00:28.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, it's November... Tsuwabuki-kun.{It is November now, Tsuwabuki-kun.[Use a contraction or no? -Xien]}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:36.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Just as I expected, your memory is in a mess.{[Just as I suspected? ^-^;; -Xien]} {Just as I suspected, your memory is a mess. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.59,0:00:45.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This must be the effect of being exposed to magic from Figurare too many times.{That must the side effect of receiving special power from Figurare too many times.["This must be the side effect of receiving Figurare's special power too many times." ?]}{That must be the side effect of being exposed to Figurare's magic for too many times. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:48.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Is something going to happen to me?{Something will happen to me?["Will something happen to me? -Xien]}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.02,0:00:51.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,When all seven star drops are gathered, {in the future,[I think it's alright to omit 'in the future'... -Xien]}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.54,0:00:57.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I will then use them to concoct a medicine to return you to normal as Tsuwabuki Masaharu. {I will use then to concoct a medicine to return you to normal. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.32,0:00:59.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.23,0:01:07.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,you will forget everything that happened this past half year, Tsuwabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.41,0:01:13.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You will forget all that time that you shared with Sumomo-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:14.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.49,0:03:05.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm... Err....
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.69,0:03:06.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.18,0:03:14.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Err, the Yuki-chan that I slept together with, {Err, the Yuki-chan that I slept together with, - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:17.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,bathed together, and also kissed...  {bathed together, and also kissed with... umm.. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.23,0:03:19.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:22.32,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,is actually Haru-kun? {was actually Haru-kun? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.99,0:03:24.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.40,0:03:30.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's so...! {That's so... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.67,0:03:38.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing, Sumomo? {Intentional name clippage? - megu}{What are you doing, Sumo... mo? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.39,0:03:42.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This is so embarrassing!{[This?]}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.17,0:03:49.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun saw me too...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.70,0:03:52.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No I didn't! Well I did, but... {No, I didn't! Well... I did, but... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.72,0:03:55.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,How can I say this... During that time, it was kind of different.{During that time, how can I say this, it was kind of different.}{during that time, how do you say this, it's kind of different[That time, how do you say this, was kind of different? -Xien]} {During that time... how do you say this, it's kind of different. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.57,0:03:57.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I was Yuki-chan, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:04:00.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm... so that is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.72,0:04:03.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So you did see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.95,0:04:15.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Right, I haven't told Sumomo anything about what Kisaragi-sensei told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:20.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If you stay as you are and don't do anything,{If you just keep on staying like that and not doing anything,} {If you keep on staying as you are and doing nothing, - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.42,0:04:23.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,the time will come when you will permanently stay as a doll.{then the time will come when you will turn into just a doll.}{then the time will come when you will permanently turn into a doll. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.95,0:04:26.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have any other choice here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.50,0:04:28.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.94,0:04:37.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}A few months passed without me telling her about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.32,0:04:42.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So, Sensei, with these past six months...{So what you're saying Sensei is that after Tsuwabuki-kun returns to normal,}{So, what you are saying is that after Tsuwabuki-kun returns to normal, - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.76,0:04:46.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,...you're saying that Tsuwabuki... will forget all of it?{...that these past six months, Tsuwabuki-kun... will forget all of it?}{this past half year, he will forget... everything?}{past half year -> past six months == the same? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.93,0:04:48.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Even about him seeing Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:56.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's... cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.81,0:04:58.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.39,0:05:00.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It was my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.44,0:05:03.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Everything was... my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.27,0:05:07.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuki, it's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.48,0:05:10.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yaeno-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.15,0:05:17.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo and Tsuwabuki definitely don't hate or blame anyone.{Sumomo and Tsuwabuki are definitely not hating or blaming anyone. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.16,0:05:23.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That is why those two managed to make it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.73,0:05:31.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Saying that the reason why Sumomo-chan, who never used a Ladle before was able to excel at using it...{<--rewording}{Saying that reason why Sumomo chan, who has never used a ladle before, was able to excel using it... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:35.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,...was because of a sheep doll, did sound unusual.{ <---rewording}{was because a sheel doll helped, does sound out of place - or "does sound unusual/wierd" - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.57,0:05:40.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It was certainly strange even to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:44.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But now, I am sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.16,0:05:47.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,They are both each other's strength.{That those are both their strength.}{Their strength came from both of them. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.67,0:05:54.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The kindness that is shared between them became a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:05:56.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.65,0:06:04.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's somewhat strange, but yet, it happened like that.{Yes it happened like that. Isn't it strange?[Is there a way to reword it and combine the sentences?]}{It's somewhat strange, but yes, it happened like that. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.10,0:06:05.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.81,0:06:09.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.16,0:06:14.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun, the star drop will fall down tonight.{Will fall down?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:19.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The seventh star drop will come!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.52,0:06:23.32,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.69,0:06:27.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.91,0:06:30.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.20,0:06:32.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.78,0:06:33.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:37.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I'm happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.68,0:06:39.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,because Haru-kun is in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.99,0:06:40.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:44.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, tonight, Dad will be at an event so no one else will be home.{Umm, tonight, Dad's going to an event, so nobody else will be at home. - megu}{No parents? In my game-to-anime series? I got a baaaaaaaad feeling about this. >_>; - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.32,0:06:47.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,He said it might be pretty scary, so it'd be better just to stay at home... {He said that it might be scary, so it might be better to just stay at home... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.96,0:06:51.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ahh! By staying, he didn't mean like staying for the night or anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.90,0:06:54.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,W-What am I saying...!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:55.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.69,0:07:01.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, so we'll finally be able to gather all seven star drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.49,0:07:39.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The seventh star drop will come from that side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.20,0:07:46.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The day we've been waiting for has finally come, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:50.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,We've gathered them one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:07:58.12,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Puruvu Radi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:02.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Always together with Yuki-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:08.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Always being encouraged by Yuki-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.64,0:08:19.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And being given courage by Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.56,0:08:31.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.52,0:08:38.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There were some hard times too during this past half year, but it was fun. {There were some hard times during this past half year too, but it was fun. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.01,0:08:44.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's too bad we can't be together tonight to capture the seventh star drop since it's a new moon.{It's too bad that we can't be together to capture the seventh star drop tonight. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.24,0:08:49.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's kind of lonely because we can't meet, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.05,0:08:54.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This time, I can be together with Haru-kun for the whole evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.27,0:09:00.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I hope that like I did with Yuki-chan, Haru-kun will have fun too.{I hope that like what Yuki-chan did for me, Haru-kun will have fun too.}{I hope I can make Haru-kun have fun just like Yuki-chan made mine.}{I hope I can make my time with Haru-kun fun, just as Yuki-chan made with mine. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.55,0:09:01.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.16,0:09:06.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it won't be as mysterious as before, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.56,0:09:11.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, I have to tell you something!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.20,0:09:15.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.61,0:09:21.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There is something that I haven't told you, Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:26.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,When we gather the star drops... all seven of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.21,0:09:29.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,After that...{and then...}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.49,0:09:31.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,After that happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.62,0:09:35.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry... I'll...{Sorry I...}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:43.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So something will happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.71,0:09:47.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Something sad...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.86,0:09:54.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I had this premonition...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:10:02.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Because everything has been going all too well with Haru-kun.{Because everything is going too well with Haru-kun.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.36,0:10:11.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That perhaps it's all just a dream... and that everything will disappear when I open my eyes. {That perhaps, it's all just a dream... everything will disappear after I open my eyes. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.25,0:10:17.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I felt afraid...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.86,0:10:23.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That when we would capture the final star drop... {capture -> catch}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.61,0:10:29.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun would disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.00,0:10:30.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It felt like...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.27,0:10:37.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.42,0:10:41.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.42,0:10:47.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,When all seven star drops are gathered...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:51.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,After drinking the medicine and returning to normal...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:54.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.53,0:10:57.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.79,0:11:00.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,will forget everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.59,0:11:03.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.93,0:11:06.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,From the moment I turned into Yuki-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.27,0:11:07.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,...and everything after that.{What happened after that.}{And whatever happened after that... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.68,0:11:10.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The time we spent together...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.03,0:11:12.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,My feelings...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.87,0:11:20.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I will forget... just about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.77,0:11:34.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The first time going home together...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.34,0:11:42.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,We planted a lot of hydrangeas, didn't we? {hydrangeas (plural_ - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.44,0:11:47.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I got to talk to Haru-kun when we were alone together.{I got talk to Haru-kun while being alone together.}{I got to talk to Haru-kun, with just the two of us. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.21,0:11:53.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,My heart felt like it skipped a beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.51,0:11:59.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It was always beating so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.54,0:12:05.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to forget... everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.63,0:12:19.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I... I don't want you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.20,0:12:23.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want you... to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:30.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No, I don't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.91,0:12:33.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun, Haru-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.84,0:12:51.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.33,0:12:57.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.48,0:13:02.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to forget either!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.36,0:13:07.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to forget...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.43,0:13:09.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,about you, Sumomo.{.[Er? -Xien]}{Just "Sumomo."? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:13.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.41,0:13:26.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.13,0:13:32.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like it's encouraging us...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.93,0:13:35.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,saying "Don't cry"...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.38,0:13:39.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,and that the seventh star drop is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.86,0:13:44.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.28,0:13:50.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun needs to return to normal. {Haru-kun needs to turn back to normal. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.99,0:13:52.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.28,0:14:16.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Before I forget just about everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.96,0:14:21.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I want to imprint Sumomo's figure in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.50,0:14:34.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Being as lovely as she is,{Even though she is this lovely...}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.45,0:14:40.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}will I really forget these feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.38,0:14:54.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.03,0:14:57.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Haru-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.60,0:15:07.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If only this moment would last longer, even by just a second. {even by just a second. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.16,0:15:13.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If only our time lasted longer by even just a second. {same as above - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.58,0:15:16.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It would be good if time could just stop.{It will be good if time just freeze.}{I wish that time just froze. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.15,0:15:46.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's too bad... We don't really remember which boat we used that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.78,0:15:53.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That time, I was really shy and embarrassed, so I was at a loss of what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.74,0:15:55.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:16.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,They were in full bloom at that time...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:28.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's right, Sumomo. Remember the bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.10,0:16:31.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The Bell of Hope, right? Let's go take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.33,0:16:33.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.13,0:16:39.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,When the bell rings while a couple is together...{If a couple were to ring it... umm...}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.68,0:16:40.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.84,0:16:44.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,the couple's future will be connected.{They will be together in the future!}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.99,0:16:50.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The bell which we didn't ring that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.67,0:16:59.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}After that we just sat down together without saying anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.07,0:17:03.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}...until the last moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.17,0:17:30.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The ring is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:36.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun, let me see your cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.90,0:17:44.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll delete all the messages that I've sent to you and also my e-mail address, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.84,0:17:49.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That way, you don't feel strange looking at it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.59,0:17:51.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Eh, Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:59.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It was only for two months, but there is a lot here already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:28.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The star drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.59,0:18:33.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The other star drops too...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.38,0:18:37.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.60,0:18:43.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.00,0:18:47.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.88,0:18:55.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I forget everything, I... I will...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.67,0:19:01.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I will love Sumomo once again. I know it!{Love Sumomo one more time, definitely!}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:08.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.82,0:19:10.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:14.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. I'll be waiting, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.65,0:19:17.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll wait without crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:11.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning! {students voices}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.59,0:20:12.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.53,0:20:13.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.67,0:20:17.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What does that mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.44,0:20:20.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Is it true that Tsuwabuki-kun lost his memory?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.42,0:20:22.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.07,0:20:27.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know the details, but according to Kisaragi-sensei,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:34.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki lost all of his memory of this past half year. {Tsuwabuki-kun lost his memory of this past half year. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.07,0:20:37.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This past half year?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.21,0:20:41.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,T-Then, what about his going out with Sumomo?{Then, how about him going out with Sumomo?}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.18,0:20:47.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,T-Then he really forgot everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.08,0:20:49.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This can't be! Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.14,0:20:51.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.89,0:20:55.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let's tell him everything about this past half year!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.19,0:20:57.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's right, let's do it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.39,0:20:58.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No, you shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.75,0:21:01.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No, you shouldn't do it now. {You shouldn't do it now. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.39,0:21:05.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's better if we don't tell Tsuwabuki anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.92,0:21:10.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If we confuse him now, there's a chance it'll get worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.63,0:21:15.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.28,0:21:18.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I feel bad for Sumomo-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.89,0:21:26.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I won't cry...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.85,0:21:33.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}because... because Haru-kun made a promise to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.80,0:21:41.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Haru-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.14,0:21:50.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,A-Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.59,0:21:54.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.00,0:21:59.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.62,0:22:05.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm... Well, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.20,0:22:06.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.68,0:22:09.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry too, Tsuwabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.47,0:22:12.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,How do you know my name?{Why do you know my name?[How?]}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.36,0:22:16.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,We're in the same class.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.13,0:22:17.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.10,0:22:19.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.46,0:22:27.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.42,0:22:33.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I believe in you, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.16,0:22:39.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's a promise, so I'll wait and I won't cry...{It's a promise so I will wait and not cry.}{It's a promise, so I will wait, and I won't cry. -megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.45,0:22:43.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,...Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.13,0:24:22.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Aww, the last episode is already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.47,0:24:23.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.60,0:24:25.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be so sad for Sumomo if things keep on going like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.82,0:24:28.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Please God let them be happy together!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.60,0:24:29.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's right, Haru!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.35,0:24:31.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll not forgive you if you make a cute girl like her cry! {I won't forgive you if you make a cute girl like her cry! - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.64,0:24:32.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.70,0:24:34.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,They will definitely have a happy ending! {They will definitely have a happy ending! - megu}
